MEMINFO(1)

NAME
    meminfo - show memory summary

SYNOPSIS
    meminfo

DESCRIPTION
    Prints kernel memory totals and allocation information.

    The report includes the permanent kernel heap range, PMM free/total/used
    frame counts, shared/refcounted frame diagnostics, process registry usage,
    process-owned page categories, reclaimable kalloc usage, read-only file
    cache totals, and E820 availability.

    Existing labels are kept stable for scripts, and newer accounting fields
    are appended in additional lines.

SEE ALSO
    top(1), procscaleprobe(1), memleakprobe(1), lifetimeprobe(1), cowprobe(1)
